      {
        "id": 161266,
        "name": "BAMJoe",
        "username": "BAMJoe",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/a698b9/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-14T13:25:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jlabrecque42\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/ecccb3/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jlabrecque42:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>BAMJoe wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;jlabrecque42 wrote:<br><blockquote>I wish the box was bigger. &nbsp;I love this game, and because I want it to last, I double sleeve my cards with KMC perfect fits inner and KMC Hyper Matte Clear outer. &nbsp;This way I can get maximum protection, and I can enjoy the awesome artwork on both sides of the cards.Unfortunately, the box would have to be 5-7\" longer, or tall enough for one more row of drawers to accomodate the thickness of double sleeves. &nbsp;I realize that I'm on the extreme end of sleeving, and people who don't sleeve would have a box with waaaayyy too much empty space. &nbsp;My solution will probably end up being the Ultimate Collectors Cases for everything except the Vengence Villains, and maybe a few less played environments and villains in one of the core boxes.Still crossing my fingers that it will be slightly larger though.... &nbsp;1.5 million stretch goal anyone :)&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nWow, the cost for all of these sleeves would cost way more than the games themselves. &nbsp;I am not judging (I did the same for my Mage Knight cards), I wish I could do that as well.\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;The key is to buy in bulk and spread it out over the course of several months. &nbsp;I like to bring SoTM to my weekly boardgame club and some of the younger folks were a little too careless with the cards for my taste. &nbsp;I love the game and I want it to last, so I use my monthly boardgame budget toward sleeves when I can get a good deal.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Where do you pick up your Hyper Mattes in bulk? &nbsp;I have been looking for a good deal.</p>",
